msgstr "）——请核对上方参数取值（如 BizType 策略编号）后重试。"

msgid ") — please check the values in the configuration area above and retry."
msgstr "）——请核对上方配置区取值后重试。"

msgid ") — please try again later (networks without an international exit will keep seeing this state)."
msgstr "）——请稍后再试（无国际出口的网络环境会持续此态）。"

msgid ") — please try again later."
msgstr "）——请稍后再试。"

msgid ") — retry later; if it keeps failing, check the endpoint URL (mind the path prefix: the plugin appends /chat/completions and /models to whatever you enter)."
msgstr "）——稍后重试；持续失败请核对接入地址（注意路径前缀：插件在所填地址后拼 /chat/completions 与 /models）。"

msgid ") — retry later; if it keeps failing, check the endpoint URL."
msgstr "）——稍后重试；持续失败请核对接入地址。"

msgid ") — the credential and signing chain works, but the fake parameters were not rejected as expected; retry or screenshot this message for troubleshooting."
msgstr "）——凭据与签名链路已通，但假参未被业务层按预期拒绝；可重试或截图此信息联系排查。"

msgid ") — the credential and signing chain works, but the probe text did not get a clean verdict; retry or screenshot this message for troubleshooting."
msgstr "）——凭据与签名链路已通，但探测文本未获干净判定；可重试或截图此信息联系排查。"

msgid ") — the credential and signing chain works, but the sample text did not get Pass; retry or screenshot this message for troubleshooting."
msgstr "）——凭据与签名链路已通，但样本文本未获 Pass；可重试或截图此信息联系排查。"

msgid ") — the credential and token chain works, but the probe text was not judged compliant; retry or screenshot this message for troubleshooting."
msgstr "）——凭据与 token 链路已通，但探测文本未获合规判定；可重试或截图此信息联系排查。"

msgid ") — the moderation chain is connected; once enabled, comments will be submitted through “local rules → Aliyun Text Moderation Plus” in series."
msgstr "）——审核链路已通；启用后评论将按「本地规则 → 阿里文本审核 PLUS」串联送审。"

msgid ") — you can start again."
msgstr "）——可重新 start。"

msgid "). Run resume to continue."
msgstr "）。resume 继续。"

msgid "): API Key invalid — check it on the DeepSeek open platform and retry."
msgstr "）：API Key 无效——请到 DeepSeek 开放平台核对后重试。"

msgid "): the API Key/Secret Key was rejected by Baidu Cloud — check the API Key and Secret Key under “Baidu AI Cloud Console → App List” and retry."
msgstr "）：API Key/Secret Key 被百度云拒绝——请到「百度智能云控制台 → 应用列表」核对 API Key 与 Secret Key 后重试。"

msgid "): visitor data: "
msgstr "）提供访客信息："

msgid ")— please try again later."
msgstr ")——请稍后再试。"

msgid ", "
msgstr "，"

msgid ", a normal business rejection of the all-parameter fake ticket) — the front-end captcha should come up; if the comment area still shows loading, check the front-end network or theme scripts."
msgstr "，全参假票的正常业务拒绝）——前端验证码应可拉起；若评论区仍显示加载中，请查前端网络或主题脚本。"

msgid ", about "
msgstr " 开启，还剩约 "

msgid ", at most "
msgstr "，单轮 ≤"

msgid ", fake parameters normally rejected at the business layer — gateway auth + AccessKey + RAM all pass) — the front-end captcha should come up; if the comment area still shows loading, check the front-end network or theme scripts."
msgstr "，假参被业务层正常拒绝——网关鉴权+AccessKey+RAM 全通）——前端验证码应可拉起；若评论区仍显示加载中，请查前端网络或主题脚本。"

msgid ", last reset)"
msgstr " 上次清零起）"

msgid ", or "
msgstr "，或在"

msgid ", resumes automatically tomorrow"
msgstr "，次日自动恢复"

msgid "-"
msgstr "月"

msgid "."
msgstr "。"

msgid ". Settings were saved, but the driver counts as not configured until they are filled in (captcha stage skipped entirely, comment gate relies on content filtering only)."
msgstr "。设置已保存，但该驱动在补齐前视为未配置（验证码阶段整体跳过，评论闸仅内容过滤生效）。"

msgid ". Settings were saved, but the driver counts as not configured until they are filled in (the relevant check stages are skipped as “not configured”)."
msgstr "。设置已保存，但该驱动在补齐前视为未配置（相关检查阶段按「未配置」语义跳过）。"

msgid "1. Create an API Key on the DeepSeek open platform (platform.deepseek.com) and top up (pay-as-you-go; one verdict costs roughly a few hundred tokens)."
msgstr "1. DeepSeek 开放平台（platform.deepseek.com）创建 API Key 并充值（按量计费，判定一次约几百 token）。"

msgid "1. Enable “Content Moderation · Text Moderation” (current v2 endpoint, text moderation is pay-as-you-go) in the Baidu AI Cloud console."
msgstr "1. 百度智能云控制台开通「内容审核 · 文本审核」（现行 v2 端点，文本审核按量计费）。"

msgid "1. Enable “Content Security · Text Moderation Plus” (TextModerationPlus, Green 2022-03-02) in the Aliyun console."
msgstr "1. 阿里云控制台开通「内容安全 · 文本审核增强版」（TextModerationPlus，Green 2022-03-02）。"

msgid "1. Enable “Content Security · Text Moderation” in the Tencent Cloud console and purchase/claim a package (TextModeration is billed per policy)."
msgstr "1. 腾讯云控制台开通「内容安全 · 文本审核」并购买/领取套餐包（TextModeration 按策略计费）。"

msgid "1. Go to the Aliyun Captcha 2.0 console to enable the service (pay-as-you-go, with a free tier)."
msgstr "1. 前往阿里云验证码 2.0 控制台开通服务（按量计费，有免费额度档）。"

msgid "1. Go to the Tencent Cloud captcha console to enable the service (free to enable; verifications are billed by package)."
msgstr "1. 前往腾讯云验证码控制台开通验证码服务（免费开通，验证量按套餐计费）。"

msgid "1. The endpoint must provide chat/completions (OpenAI-compatible) — relay sites, self-built gateways (LiteLLM and the like), or any compatible vendor all work."
msgstr "1. 端点需提供 chat/completions（OpenAI 兼容）——中转站/自建网关（LiteLLM 类）/任意兼容厂商皆可。"

msgid "2. Create a verification scene under “Scene Management” and get the SceneId (required — the server re-sends it to prevent front-end tampering; a mismatch returns F012)."
msgstr "2. 在【场景管理】创建验证场景，获取 SceneId（必填——服务端补传防前端篡改场景，错配返回 F012）。"

msgid "2. Create a verification scene under “Verification Management” and get the CaptchaAppId and AppSecretKey (the key column is on the same page)."
msgstr "2. 在【验证管理】创建验证场景，获取 CaptchaAppId 与 AppSecretKey（密钥列同页）。"

msgid "2. Create an app under “App List” in the console to get the API Key and Secret Key (AppID is a console label only and takes no part in requests)."
msgstr "2. 控制台「应用列表」创建应用获取 API Key 与 Secret Key（AppID 仅控制台标识，不参与请求）。"

msgid "2. Fill in the endpoint URL (mind the path prefix: the plugin appends /chat/completions to whatever you enter — for the official OpenAI family, fill in up to …/v1)."
msgstr "2. 填接入地址（注意路径前缀：插件在所填地址后拼 /chat/completions——OpenAI 官方族需填到 …/v1 为止）。"

msgid "2. Get the policy ID (BizType) from the Content Security console (e.g. TencentCloudDefault or a custom policy) — a package-bound policy is recommended."
msgstr "2. 内容安全控制台获取策略编号（BizType，如 TencentCloudDefault 或自定义策略）——建议填写绑定套餐包的策略。"

msgid "2. Paste the API Key below → click “Test credentials” (balance probe, zero cost — it also verifies the key works and the account is active, showing the balance)."
msgstr "2. 粘贴 API Key 至下方 → 点「测试凭据」（余额探测，零费用——顺带验证 Key 有效与账户可用，显示余额数字）。"

msgid "2. Prepare a RAM AccessKey pair (it can share the RAM user with Captcha 2.0 — one account, two product lines, per L0 field notes) and grant it AliyunYundunGreenWebFullAccess."
msgstr "2. 准备 RAM AccessKey 对（可与验证码 2.0 共用同一 RAM 用户——同一账号双产品线，L0 实测注记），并授予 AliyunYundunGreenWebFullAccess 权限。"

msgid "3. Fill in the API Key and model name → click “Test credentials” (model-list probe, zero token cost — generic endpoints have no standard balance API, so no balance is shown)."
msgstr "3. 填 API Key 与模型名 → 点「测试凭据」（模型列表探活，零 token 消耗——泛端点无标准余额 API，不显示余额）。"

msgid "3. Get the prefix from the console overview page (front-end identity tag, used by the global AliyunCaptchaConfig)."
msgstr "3. 在控制台概览页获取 prefix（前端身份标，AliyunCaptchaConfig 全局配置用）。"

msgid "3. Go to “Access Management → API Key Management” to prepare the CAM key pair SecretId/SecretKey (for TC3 signing; a separate credential system from the captcha console keys)."
msgstr "3. 前往「访问管理 → API 密钥管理」准备 CAM 密钥对 SecretId/SecretKey（TC3 签名用，与验证码控制台密钥分属两套凭据体系）。"

msgid "3. Paste below (the dual service names default to nickname/comment_detection_pro and rarely need changes) → click “Test credentials”."
msgstr "3. 粘贴至下方（双 Service 名默认 nickname/comment_detection_pro，一般无需修改）→ 点「测试凭据」。"

msgid "3. Paste below → click “Test credentials” (a normal text test should return compliant)."
msgstr "3. 粘贴至下方 → 点「测试凭据」（正常文本实测应返回合规）。"

msgid "3. Prepare a CAM key pair (Access Management → API Key Management; same system as the captcha CAM keys, the pair can be reused)."
msgstr "3. 准备 CAM 密钥对（访问管理 → API 密钥管理，与验证码的 CAM 密钥同体系，可复用同对）。"

msgid "3. “Low-confidence auto-upgrade” is on by default: comments the AI is unsure about are re-judged once with the “reasoner” model, at most two judgments per comment."
msgstr "3. 「低置信自动升级」默认开：AI 拿不准的评论自动换「深思」模型再判一次，每条评论最多判两次。"

msgid "4. Go to “Access Management → RAM” to create an AccessKey pair (main-account AKs forbidden) and grant AliyunYundunAFSFullAccess."
msgstr "4. 前往「访问管理 → RAM」创建 AccessKey 对（禁主账号 AK），并授权 AliyunYundunAFSFullAccess。"

msgid "4. Paste below → click “Test credentials” (a normal text test should return Pass)."
msgstr "4. 粘贴至下方 → 点「测试凭据」（正常文本实测应返回 Pass）。"

msgid "4. Paste the four fields into the configuration area above (keys are server-side only and never exposed to the front end)."
msgstr "4. 将四个字段粘贴至上方配置区（密钥仅服务端使用，绝不输出前端）。"

msgid "4. Reachability and compliance are on you: data goes to the jurisdiction of the endpoint you enter (intranet addresses are not supported — the transport spine rejects private networks first)."
msgstr "4. 可达性与合规由站长自负：数据送你填的端点所在辖区（不支持内网地址——传输脊私网拒绝红线优先）。"

msgid "4. Verdict mapping (not admin-adjustable): RiskLevel none/low → pass, medium → pending review, high → direct block; band boundaries live in the Aliyun console rule config. For a medium/low middle band and decimal confidence scores, enable fine-grained detection in the Content Security console rule config."
msgstr "4. 判定映射（站长不可调）：RiskLevel none/low→放行、medium→入待审、high→直接拦截；分档界线在阿里控制台规则配置。如需 medium/low 中间态与小数置信分，请在内容安全控制台规则配置中开启细粒度检测。"

msgid "4. Verdict mapping (not admin-adjustable): conclusionType 1 compliant → pass, 2 non-compliant → direct block, 3 suspected → pending review; the access_token is cached and reused by the plugin (30-day validity, no manual management)."
msgstr "4. 判定映射（站长不可调）：conclusionType 1 合规→放行、2 不合规→直接拦截、3 疑似→入待审；access_token 由插件缓存复用（30 天有效期，无需手动管理）。"

msgid "4. Verdict mapping (not admin-adjustable): confidence ≥0.8 is taken as high confidence, <0.8 always goes to pending review; an AI pass never approves a comment by itself (it only tightens)."
msgstr "4. 判定映射（站长不可调）：置信 ≥0.8 高置信直取、<0.8 一律入待审；AI 判 pass 不替评论放行（只放大严）。"

msgid "5. Click “Test credentials” — three-state verdict: green = credentials work; red = CAM key error; yellow = required parameters missing."
msgstr "5. 点击「测试凭据」——三态判定：绿=凭据可用；红=CAM 密钥错；黄=必填参数缺。"

msgid "5. Paste the four fields into the configuration area above (keys are server-side only and never exposed to the front end)."
msgstr "5. 将四个字段粘贴至上方配置区（密钥仅服务端使用，绝不输出前端）。"

msgid "6. Click “Test credentials” — three-state verdict: green = credentials work; red = AK/signature/permission error; yellow = required fields missing."
msgstr "6. 点击「测试凭据」——三态判定：绿=凭据可用；红=AK/签名/权限错；黄=必填字段缺。"

msgid "8-second timeout (guardrail range); the AI verdict only tightens: even a pass never approves a comment."
msgstr "超时 8 秒（防呆范围）；AI 判定只放大严：判 pass 也不会替评论放行。"

msgid "8.8.8.8 or 2001:db8::1"
msgstr "8.8.8.8 或 2001:db8::1"

msgid ":"
msgstr "："

msgid ": API Key invalid"
msgstr "：API Key 无效"

msgid ": subscription or daily quota unavailable"
msgstr "：订阅或每日配额不可用"

