msgid "The built-in rules (local rules) are always on duty, depend on no external service, and need no keys"
msgstr "站内规矩（本地规则）始终在岗，不依赖任何外部服务，无需密钥"

msgid "The built-in rules alone are enough — cloud moderation is an enhancement layer that leaves basic protection untouched; when enabled, comments the built-in rules do not block get one more round of cloud review."
msgstr "只配站内规矩也能用——云端审核是增强层，不配不影响基本防护；配了会把站内规矩拦不住的评论再送审一遍。"

