msgstr "这条评论刚刚已经发过一遍了——是手滑连点了两下？返回看看它是否已经在排队/显示。"

msgid "This connection looks a bit suspicious. If you are a regular visitor, try another network or come back later; if you think this is a false positive: {contact_email}"
msgstr "这次连接的来路有点可疑。如果你是正常访客，换个网络或稍后再来；认为是误判：{contact_email}"

msgid "This connection looks suspicious"
msgstr "这次连接的来路有点可疑"

