msgstr "配好任意一家后本提示自动消失。"

msgid "This panel shows the parsing of the current page request as it happened; the manual query below sends the entered IP to four providers (AbuseIPDB / StopForumSpam / ip.nc.gy / ip.sb) — results are shown for this request only, never stored, cached, or counted."
msgstr "本面板展示「当前这次页面请求」的解析实况；下方手动查询会把所输 IP 发往四个服务商（AbuseIPDB / StopForumSpam / ip.nc.gy / ip.sb）——结果仅本次展示、不落库不缓存、不计调用次数。"

msgid "This plugin shows them read-only and never changes their behavior; to adjust, go to "
msgstr "本插件只读展示、不改这两个开关的行为；如需调整请到"

msgid "This plugin's block archive holds %1$s entries (threshold %2$s) — WP's native spam cleanup (30 days by default) handles it automatically, or clear it manually under the Spam category; archiving can also be disabled in settings."
msgstr "本插件拦截留档已 %1$s 条（阈值 %2$s）——WP 原生垃圾清理（默认 30 天）会自动处理，或到垃圾评论分类手动清空；也可在设置中关闭留档。"

msgid "Threat group: AbuseIPDB (score / usage / ISP / Tor) · StopForumSpam (blacklist hits / frequency) · ip.nc.gy (proxy / VPN / Tor / hosting / CDN / anonymity — six flags); geo group: ip.sb (location / ISP / ASN). 3-second timeout per source; a failing source fails only its own card while the rest still report."
msgstr "威胁组：AbuseIPDB（评分/用途/ISP/Tor）· StopForumSpam（黑名单出现/频次）· ip.nc.gy（代理/VPN/Tor/机房/CDN/匿名六旗）；地理组：ip.sb（归属地/ISP/ASN）。查询超时 3 秒/源；任一源失败仅该卡片失败，其余照常出数。"

