msgid "Verdict mapping (not admin-adjustable): RiskLevel none/low → pass, medium → pending review, high → direct block; the band boundaries live in the Aliyun console's rule config. For a medium/low middle band and decimal confidence scores, enable fine-grained detection in the Content Security console rules."
msgstr "判定映射（站长不可调）：RiskLevel none/low→放行、medium→入待审、high→直接拦截；分档界线在阿里控制台规则配置。如需 medium/low 中间态与小数置信分，请在内容安全控制台规则配置中开启细粒度检测。"

msgid "Verdict mapping (not admin-adjustable): conclusionType 1 compliant → pass, 2 non-compliant → direct block, 3 suspected → pending review; the access_token is cached and reused by the plugin (30-day validity, no manual management)."
msgstr "判定映射（站长不可调）：conclusionType 1 合规→放行、2 不合规→直接拦截、3 疑似→入待审；access_token 由插件缓存复用（30 天有效期，无需手动管理）。"

msgid "Verdict mapping (not admin-adjustable): confidence ≥0.8 is taken as high confidence, <0.8 always goes to pending review; an AI pass never approves a comment by itself (it only tightens, never loosens)."
msgstr "判定映射（站长不可调）：置信 ≥0.8 高置信直取、<0.8 一律入待审；AI 判 pass 不替评论放行（只放大严）。"

