msgstr "访客 IP、验证 token"

msgid "Visitors (same nickname + email) or logged-in users with N approved comments are waived; the comparable WP core precedent is 1, and because a captcha waiver is stronger, the default is tightened to 3."
msgstr "游客（同昵称+邮箱）或登录用户已有 N 条通过审核的评论即免验；WP 核心同类先例为 1，验证码豁免更强故默认收紧至 3。"

