msgstr "网站"

msgid "Website-field collection is off — new comments carry no URL to check, so this feature auto-disables for new comments; existing URLs can still be handled via “Existing URL check” on the tools page."
msgstr "网站字段收集已关闭——新评论没有网址可核查，本功能对新评论自动失效；存量网址仍可在工具页「存量网址核查」中处理。"

