msgstr "出了什么岔子"

msgid "Whatever you finished counts — below is your current protection checklist; missing items can be added later on the settings page."
msgstr "配好几步算几步——下面是你当前的防护清单，缺的项随时可在设置页补。"

msgid "When Akismet has already tossed the same spam into its queue, this plugin's built-in rules skip re-challenging (the decision is still fully logged to this plugin's event table). Planned row — audit notes in docs/reports/DESIGN-AKISMET-AUDIT-2026-11-13.md, to be implemented after sign-off; detect and yield, never touching the other plugin's config."
msgstr "Akismet 已把同名垃圾扔进其队列时，本插件站内规矩不再重复出码拦截（判定留痕仍全量落本插件事件表）。规划行——审计底稿 docs/reports/DESIGN-AKISMET-AUDIT-2026-11-13.md，施工拍板后实装；检测即让位、不代改对方配置。"

msgid "When IP reputation is disabled the trust chain skips it, leaving waiver eligibility and login counts untouched; when enabled, any misconfiguration / timeout / error / over-threshold is judged strictly (treated as a fail and a captcha is shown outright) — configuring IP reputation is recommended for stronger protection."
msgstr "未启用 IP 信誉时，信任链跳过该项，不影响免验资格与登录计数；启用后若配置异常/超时/报错/超阈值，将从严判定（按不通过处理，直接展示验证码）——建议配置 IP 信誉以提升防护。"

msgid "When REMOTE_ADDR is outside the trusted ranges, forwarding headers are ignored outright (anti-forgery invariant)."
msgstr "REMOTE_ADDR 不在受信网段时，转发头一律忽略（防伪造不变式）。"

msgid "When a page will not open, search results can still serve as clues, reducing “could not tell” cases (off by default)"
msgstr "打不开网页时，搜索结果也能当判定线索，减少「没看清」的次数（默认关）"

msgid "When disabled the trust chain skips it, leaving waiver eligibility and login counts untouched; when enabled, any misconfiguration / timeout / error / over-threshold is judged strictly (treated as a fail — a captcha is shown)."
msgstr "未启用时信任链跳过该项，不影响信用免验资格与登录计数；启用后若配置异常/超时/报错/超阈值，将从严判定（按不通过处理，出码验证）。"

msgid "When enabled, before comment and login verdicts the visitor's IP reputation score is looked up at AbuseIPDB — malicious IPs must pass human verification before going through."
msgstr "启用后，评论与登录判定前会向 AbuseIPDB 查询访客 IP 的信誉分——恶意 IP 强制访客先过人机验证再放行。"

msgid "When enabled, site-wide human verification is bypassed — for pipeline drills only."
msgstr "启用后全站人机验证旁路，仅用于链路演练。"

msgid "When enabled, the three IP reputation states take part in deciding when to show the login captcha"
msgstr "启用后按 IP 信誉三态参与登录出码判定"

msgid "When enabled, visitor IPs are submitted to the overseas service AbuseIPDB."
msgstr "启用后访客 IP 将提交至境外服务 AbuseIPDB。"

msgid "When login verification appears"
msgstr "登录验证出现时机"

msgid "When on, submissions run through “local rules → selected cloud driver” in series (failover chain)"
msgstr "开启后按「本地规则 → 已选云端驱动」串联送审（failover 链）"

msgid "When on, submissions run through “local rules → selected cloud driver” in series; local rules always stay first in the chain and cannot be turned off."
msgstr "开启后按「本地规则 → 已选云端驱动」串联送审；本地规则恒在链首不可关闭。"

msgid "When the block happened (site timezone)."
msgstr "拦截发生时间（站点时区）。"

msgid "When the official hCaptcha plugin takes over comment captchas, this plugin's captcha yields (yellow-banner notice; login / registration / recovery stay guarded by this plugin). On by default."
msgstr "官方 hCaptcha 插件接管评论验证码时，本插件验证码让位（黄条提示；登录/注册/找回仍由本插件把守）。默认开。"

msgid "When the official hCaptcha plugin takes over the login captcha, this plugin's login captcha yields. On by default — independent of the comment-yield switch."
msgstr "官方 hCaptcha 插件接管登录验证码时，本插件登录验证码让位。默认开——与评论让位开关各自独立。"

msgid "When the quota runs out: the batch lane stops first, new comments stay protected, and everything auto-resumes the next day."
msgstr "额度用完：批量车道先停、新评论照常防护，次日自动恢复。"

msgid "When “Complete human verification” is clicked, a pre-check runs first (four local gates + IP reputation + track record); passing everything skips the real captcha"
msgstr "点击「完成人机验证」时先预检（本地四闸 + IP 信誉 + 历史信用），全过免真实验证码"

msgid "Where to get them: Aliyun console → Captcha 2.0 → Scene management. Create a scene and copy the SceneId and prefix over together; the RAM key needs the AliyunYundunAFSFullAccess policy. After pasting, click “Test credentials” below: green = credentials work, yellow = required fields missing, red = key rejected."
msgstr "去哪拿：阿里云控制台 → 验证码 2.0 → 场景管理，创建场景后把 SceneId 与 prefix 一起复制过来；RAM 密钥需授权 AliyunYundunAFSFullAccess。粘贴后点下方「测试凭据」，绿 = 凭据通，黄 = 有字段漏填，红 = 密钥被拒。"

msgid "Which gate"
msgstr "哪个门"

msgid "Which line blocked it"
msgstr "哪道防线拦的"

msgid "Which provider"
msgstr "哪个服务商"

msgid "Who blocked it (by provider)"
msgstr "谁拦的（按服务商口径）"

msgid "Who blocked it (in chain order)"
msgstr "谁拦的（按拦截链顺序）"

msgid "Why blocked"
msgstr "为什么拦"

msgid "Why it is the default recommendation = lowest barrier to entry: Baidu AI Cloud is free to enable, pay-as-you-go, and connects directly within the mainland — with both keys in hand you are ready to go. After pasting, click “Test credentials” (a real call with a benign sample): green = credentials work, yellow = required fields missing (listed per field), red = key rejected."
msgstr "选它当默认推荐的理由＝开通门槛最低：百度智能云免费开通、按量计费、境内直连不出境，两把钥匙拿到就能用。粘贴后点「测试凭据」（良性样本真调用）：绿 = 凭据通，黄 = 必填缺（逐字段列出），红 = 密钥被拒。"

msgid "Wink WP Gatekeeper"
msgstr "Wink WP 保安"

msgid "Wink WP Gatekeeper settings sections"
msgstr "Wink WP 保安设置分区"

msgid "Wink WP Gatekeeper stands at your blog's door: it blocks spam comments, stops credential-stuffing logins, and routes suspicious content to manual review. This wizard walks you through the two most important keys — you can skip any step and come back later; skipped parts keep fallback protection, so you are never left exposed."
msgstr "Wink WP 保安是站在你的博客门口的保安：拦垃圾评论、防撞库登录、可疑内容转人工。接下来带你配好两把最关键的钥匙——配到哪一步都可以随时跳过，跳过的部分会有兜底防护，不会裸奔。"

msgid "Wink WP Gatekeeper · Today's status"
msgstr "Wink WP 保安 · 今日态势"

msgid "Wink captcha drill mode is active — site-wide human verification bypassed (auto-expires in 24h)"
msgstr "wink 验证码演练模式启用中——全站人机验证旁路（24h 自动过期）"

msgid "With DeepSeek fetching, your server no longer opens commenters' URLs itself — DeepSeek fetches the content instead (a much better success rate on blocked / anti-scraping sites, e.g. certain adult or heavily protected sites), billed per success. Direct opening is free but exposes your origin IP and often “cannot tell” on anti-scraping sites — it is never auto-enabled; select it here manually."
msgstr "选 DeepSeek 抓取时，本站服务器不再直接打开评论者的网址——由 DeepSeek 代为抓取正文（对打不开/反爬的站点成功率高很多，如某些成人站、强反爬站），按成功次数计费。本站直接打开不花钱但会暴露源站 IP，且遇到反爬站容易「没看清」——默认不自动启用，需在此手动选择。"

msgid "With both plugins verifying logins, visitors may face two captchas in a row — the detection row notes “who guards the login captcha” with a recommendation (keep one, or let one yield). Planned row — informational only, never touching the other plugin's config."
msgstr "两家都开登录验证时访客可能连过两道码——检测行提示「登录出码由谁把守」并给出建议（留一家，或一家让位）。规划行——提示性，不代改对方配置。"

msgid "With no captcha provider configured, nothing renders and nothing blocks; if “Settings → General” disallows registration, the signup form is unreachable (an idle switch is harmless); multisite signups go through wp-signup.php, which this gate does not cover."
msgstr "未配置验证码驱动时自动不渲染不拦截；「设置 → 常规」关闭任何人可注册后注册表单不可达（开关空转无害）；多站点注册走 wp-signup.php，本闸不覆盖。"

msgid "Without IP reputation the trust chain skips it and login counts are unaffected; when enabled, any misconfiguration / timeout / error / over-threshold is judged strictly (a captcha is shown outright)."
msgstr "未启用 IP 信誉时信任链跳过该项，不影响登录计数；启用后若配置异常/超时/报错/超阈值，将从严判定（直接展示验证码）。"

