msgid "Your comment has been parked in the pending queue — the site owner will review it shortly, no need to resubmit."
msgstr "这条评论先替你收进待审区了——站长稍后会看，不用重发。"

msgid "Your comment is being checked, please wait…"
msgstr "您的评论正在接收检查，请稍候……"

msgid "calls/day (0 = unlimited) — when reached, disabled for the day and handled per “failure fallback”"
msgstr "次/天（0 = 不限）——达到后当日停用并按「故障降级」处理"

msgid "calls/day (0 = unlimited) — when reached, disabled for the day and handled per “failure fallback” (billing guard, project brief §6.4)"
msgstr "次/天（0 = 不限）——达到后当日停用并按「故障降级」处理（计费防呆，立项书 §6.4）"

msgid "calls/day (0 = unlimited) — when reached, disabled for the day and handled per “failure fallback”; dual submission counts as two calls"
msgstr "次/天（0 = 不限）——达到后当日停用并按「故障降级」处理；双送按两次调用计量"

msgid "calls/day (default 900; 0 = unlimited) — once reached, no more outbound calls and everything is treated strictly as “fail” (better strict than silently waved through). The free tier's 1,000/day (agreed baseline) keeps a 5% buffer."
msgstr "次/天（默认 900；0=不限）——当日达到后不再外呼、一律按「不通过」从严处理（宁可从严不可静默放行）。免费档 1000/天（拍板统一口径）留 5% 缓冲。"

msgid "calls/day (default 950) — a 5% buffer under the free tier's 1,000/day (agreed baseline); once reached, paused for the day (triggered by 429, self-heals the next day)."
msgstr "次/天（默认 950）——免费档 1000/天（拍板统一口径）留 5% 缓冲；达到后当日停转（429 触发，次日自愈）。"

