msgstr "prefix（身份标）"

msgid "region must match the server side — the front-end SDK and the server endpoint are linked, and a mismatch errors out; after switching, run “Test credentials” once. The sgp endpoint is a static inference (not verified on a live site; the level will be disabled if live re-verification fails)."
msgstr "region 须与服务端一致——前端 SDK 与服务端 endpoint 双端联动，错配即报错；切换后建议点测试凭据实测一次。sgp 档端点为静态推断（未实机验证；若真机复验不过则该档停用）。"

msgid "remote_semantic → “Provider refused the request (check configuration or billing)” · banned_word → “Keyword blacklist hit”"
msgstr "remote_semantic → 「服务商拒绝了（查配置或欠费）」 · banned_word → 「命中关键词黑名单」"

