msgstr "robots 禁爬声明"

msgid "seconds (1–5, default 1) — a timeout is treated strictly as “fail” (captcha shown); this one key is shared by login / comment pre-check / submission."
msgstr "秒（1–5，默认 1）——超时按「不通过」从严处理（出码验证）；登录/评论预检/提交期三处共用此键。"

