msgstr "——验证码服务不稳的晴雨表"

msgid "— blocks during statistics-off periods are not counted, while the event table still records them (this page is authoritative for block details)."
msgstr "——统计开关关闭期间的拦截不计入读数，事件表照常落库（拦截明细以本页为准）。"

msgid "— length / keyword / Chinese checks, costs nothing"
msgstr "——字数 / 关键词 / 中文检查，不花钱"

