msgstr "「低置信自动升级」默认开——说明见下方开关行（段级一次）。"

msgid "“Not now” selected — the comment gate relies on the built-in rules alone and the captcha stage is skipped entirely. The overview page keeps a yellow banner reminding you to come back."
msgstr "已选择「暂不配置」——评论闸只靠站内规矩把关，验证码阶段整体跳过。总览页会持续亮黄条提醒你回来补配。"

